      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Writing Tools",
      "contextAfter": "Fixed: Resolved an issue where the attributes in the NSAttributedString passed in `writingToolsCoordinator(_:replace:in:proposedText:reason:animationParameters:completion:)` (or its companion async form) are stripped when an `NSWritingToolsCoordinator` or `UIWritingToolsCoordinator` has `resultOptions` set to `[.plainText]`. The attributes are no longer stripped but instead use the same attributes as were included by the delegate in the `NSAttributedString` returned in `writingToolsCoordinator(_:requestsContextsFor:completion:)` (or its companion async form).  (144105888)",
      "documentTitle": "iOS & iPadOS 18.5 Release Notes",
      "framework": "iOS Ipados Release Notes",
