    {
      "id": "seg:list:resolved-issues-4:0025:0001",
      "blockId": "list:resolved-issues-4:0025",
      "type": "list_item",
      "source": "Fixed: Resolved an issue where the attributes in the NSAttributedString passed in `writingToolsCoordinator(_:replace:in:proposedText:reason:animationParameters:completion:)` (or its companion async form) are stripped when an `NSWritingToolsCoordinator` or `UIWritingToolsCoordinator` has `resultOptions` set to `[.plainText]`. The attributes are no longer stripped but instead use the same attributes as were included by the delegate in the `NSAttributedString` returned in `writingToolsCoordinator(_:requestsContextsFor:completion:)` (or its companion async form).  (144105888)",
      "normalizedSource": "Fixed: Resolved an issue where the attributes in the NSAttributedString passed in `writingToolsCoordinator(_:replace:in:proposedText:reason:animationParameters:completion:)` (or its companion async form) are stripped when an `NSWritingToolsCoordinator` or `UIWritingToolsCoordinator` has `resultOptions` set to `[.plainText]`. The attributes are no longer stripped but instead use the same attributes as were included by the delegate in the `NSAttributedString` returned in `writingToolsCoordinator(_:requestsContextsFor:completion:)` (or its companion async form). (144105888)",
